{"lines": [{"start": 3, "end": 78, "text": "Never sell ChatGPT's first idea.", "words": [{"w": "Never", "s": 8, "e": 14}, {"w": "sell", "s": 19, "e": 23}, {"w": "ChatGPT's", "s": 28, "e": 54}, {"w": "first", "s": 55, "e": 62}, {"w": "idea.", "s": 64, "e": 74}]}, {"start": 82, "end": 150, "text": "Its third one costs you zero euros.", "words": [{"w": "Its", "s": 84, "e": 89}, {"w": "third", "s": 91, "e": 96}, {"w": "one", "s": 98, "e": 103}, {"w": "costs", "s": 106, "e": 116}, {"w": "you", "s": 117, "e": 120}, {"w": "zero", "s": 124, "e": 131}, {"w": "euros.", "s": 134, "e": 146}]}, {"start": 158, "end": 271, "text": "First try: an activity book on Amazon. Like everyone else's.", "words": [{"w": "First", "s": 161, "e": 167}, {"w": "try:", "s": 169, "e": 177}, {"w": "an", "s": 185, "e": 188}, {"w": "activity", "s": 189, "e": 200}, {"w": "book", "s": 202, "e": 207}, {"w": "on", "s": 208, "e": 212}, {"w": "Amazon.", "s": 213, "e": 227}, {"w": "Like", "s": 238, "e": 243}, {"w": "everyone", "s": 245, "e": 254}, {"w": "else's.", "s": 255, "e": 267}]}, {"start": 277, "end": 363, "text": "Third try: a cake pricing sheet for home bakers.", "words": [{"w": "Third", "s": 280, "e": 287}, {"w": "try:", "s": 288, "e": 296}, {"w": "a", "s": 305, "e": 308}, {"w": "cake", "s": 309, "e": 315}, {"w": "pricing", "s": 317, "e": 327}, {"w": "sheet", "s": 330, "e": 336}, {"w": "for", "s": 337, "e": 340}, {"w": "home", "s": 341, "e": 345}, {"w": "bakers.", "s": 347, "e": 360}]}, {"start": 372, "end": 452, "text": "One: get a shortlist of what beginners sell.", "words": [{"w": "One:", "s": 377, "e": 382}, {"w": "get", "s": 394, "e": 397}, {"w": "a", "s": 398, "e": 401}, {"w": "shortlist", "s": 403, "e": 416}, {"w": "of", "s": 418, "e": 420}, {"w": "what", "s": 421, "e": 425}, {"w": "beginners", "s": 425, "e": 438}, {"w": "sell.", "s": 440, "e": 448}]}, {"start": 458, "end": 597, "text": "Two: add your limits. Five hours, zero euros, no audience.", "words": [{"w": "Two:", "s": 459, "e": 467},